{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26987","headline":"喜马戴冬夜见过期无可上人不至 二 · 姚合","name":"喜马戴冬夜见过期无可上人不至 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"内殿臣相命，开罇话旧时。\n夜钟催鸟绝，积雪阻僧期。\n林静寒声远，天阴曙色迟。\n今宵复何夕，鸣佩坐相随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}